  m_Name: SeaTradingPort
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::BuildingDefinition
  id: SeaTradingPort
  displayName: Trading Port
  description: 'A customs house with a clock, warehouses and the masts of galleons
    at the quay. Build one in two of your towns on the same water and merchant ships
    sail between them: coin and goods every voyage, more for long routes between
    big towns. Pirates prey on them; lighthouses and warships keep them safer. Each
    upgrade opens one more route.'
